5.7 Before-and-after improvement preview

Purpose: an illustrative preview of how the issue might look after improvement.

Before image: the exact original uploaded photograph, byte-for-byte unchanged. Never substitute a different image. Never overwrite the original in Storage.

After image:

Generated from the exact original photo.
Modify only the defect region; preserve everything else (buildings, road, people, vehicles, trees, signage, lighting).
Use the existing grounded OpenCV inpainting pipeline (/ml/image_processor.py, /src/server/groundedCleanup.ts) where appropriate. Do not silently depend on a paid image-generation service. Do not create a different scene.
Store the preview as a separate Storage object from the original.
Always display the label: "AI-generated improvement preview. Illustrative only."
