Failure handling: if the preview cannot be generated (Python service down, no defect region found, timeout), show the original photo, a short honest explanation and a retry option. Never display a fabricated "after" image or a placeholder pretending to be one.

Verification: compare hashes of the original before and after generation to prove it is unchanged; compute a simple diff mask to confirm changes are confined to the defect region.

